Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.90,0:00:14.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Miras kalan irade...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.63,0:00:17.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Akıp giden yıllar...\Nİnsanların hayalleri...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.54,0:00:20.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Bunlar durdurulamaz.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.37,0:00:23.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1}İnsanlar özgürlüğü arzuladıkça...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.48,0:00:26.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...bunlar ebediyen var olmaya devam edecek!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.00,0:01:54.96,Author,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fad(734,0)\fs26} Türkçeleştirme & Çevirmen  {\fs}\N{\c&HFFCB00&\b1}onepacetr.net{\b0\c&HFFFFFF&} - {\c&H01BAFF&}{\b1}Zyrecon{\b0}{\c&HFFFFFF&}\N{\fs25}thx to onepace.net
